[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9060.91, "timestamp": "02:31:00", "text": "うん。それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9065.91, "timestamp": "02:31:05", "text": "ええ、そうですね。それで、えーと、最初に考えたのは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9069.07, "timestamp": "02:31:09", "text": "当初の計画は6月までだった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9073.27, "timestamp": "02:31:13", "text": "えーと、12日、3月12日、6月12日、だから4"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9076.99, "timestamp": "02:31:16", "text": "1ヶ月みたいな感じですよね？うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9079.59, "timestamp": "02:31:19", "text": "そして、そう、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9082.07, "timestamp": "02:31:22", "text": "これを最後の瞬間にやっている。私は実際"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9084.429, "timestamp": "02:31:24", "text": "4月からこれをやる予定だった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9087.15, "timestamp": "02:31:27", "text": "前進するが、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9089.755, "timestamp": "02:31:29", "author": "@Elio-Acqua", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Wjbd-Z0YR3N9pQ1x7HNCA53By8ihUatHRDx4za0HOJn6r8o47jN2AUGW7h-qjZ9G-pWV5-qt1A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hloo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9091.83, "timestamp": "02:31:31", "text": "ええ、今はスピードランニングをしています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9097.349, "timestamp": "02:31:37", "text": "ええ、そうですね。うん。それで、ああ、ルーン文字もありました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9099.99, "timestamp": "02:31:39", "text": "出産のきっかけになるよね？そうそう。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9103.03, "timestamp": "02:31:43", "text": "うん。うん。ルーンイベントが開催されていました。だから私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9104.87, "timestamp": "02:31:44", "text": "ルーン誕生に重点を置く"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9106.95, "timestamp": "02:31:46", "text": "あれ。私は「ああ、友達だよ」って感じだった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9109.91, "timestamp": "02:31:49", "text": "イベントなので、私もベストを尽くさなければならない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9111.83, "timestamp": "02:31:51", "text": "話をする良い機会になるでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9114.469, "timestamp": "02:31:54", "text": "人々とあらゆるもの。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9116.55, "timestamp": "02:31:56", "text": "うん。うん。わかった。君がそうでないことを願うよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9118.63, "timestamp": "02:31:58", "text": "雨の音は聞こえない。"}]